ace","shared_categories":"Bars, Cocktail Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":4},{"business_id":"JhpRI9m71ybWHkAqRdL0Tg","name":"The Avenue Pub","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"_Bi9kN_eR75G1eqIl7S3pA","name":"The Bulldog","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife, Restaurants","shared_category_count":3},{"business_id":"AU-B663F3MPO7W-goWwwXA","name":"B Mac's","shared_categories":"Bars, Nightlife","shared_category_count":2},{"business_id":"TMBbCDQG6bENJoQSST0XiA","name":"Brigtsen's Restaurant","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"mhrW9O0O5hXGXGnEYBVoag","name":"Jacques-Imo's Cafe","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"8KnMSrMuTI2AtHZ2LOI8OQ","name":"Maurepas Foods","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"Zi-F-YvyVOK0k5QD7lrLOg","name":"Muriel's Jackson Square","shared_categories":"Restaurants","shared_category_count":1},{"business_id":"pKykk7lnD6Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"Xjp2aV-s4peSgr7rKOftFQ","review_id":"-e1ZipjS_OMXQ_xz17lARg","date":"2017-06-07T16:40:47","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9288662672042847,"text_excerpt":"We found this place as a break from walking around all day. It was pretty low key and the bartender was very friendly. Drinks were well priced and the actual place was awesome inside. It was almost like walking into someone's home, inviting and comfortable. There was a band playing live music that sounded like it was from the 1920's, very cozy. You have to come in and check this place out!"},{"business_id":"Xjp2aV-s4peSgr7rKOftFQ","review_id":"9Hl1ru_b2iRrnIgM75Gieg","date":"2015-10-05T02:14:39","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9054627418518066,"text_excerpt":"Refreshing break from Bourbon St! Great bartenders who give good pours. Very cool atmosphere, and we were super happy to have wondered in."},{"business_id":"Xjp2aV-s4peSgr7rKOftFQ","review_id":"XpzlfpYerlKuPiQVa7ZfuA","date":"2017-08-03T16:36:44","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9003242254257202,"text_excerpt":"This is my favorite bar in the entire French Quarter. It smells absolutely wonderful (is that crepe myrtle?)! Very clean bathrooms were a huge welcome and appreciated anomaly in this neighborhood. The dark gorgeous decor is very beautiful and comfortable. Thursday night (Goth Night) is the best time to come out and see the sexy, mysterious, shadowy, and ravishing creatures of the night! You can have an almost astral journey dancing upstairs in the trippy pulsing lights or enjoy a glass of blue champagne (yes blue!) while chatting with a bewitching soul on a Victorian style stool or couch. This bar is a fantasy come to life! Please, we beg you, stay in New Orleans for all of eternity!"}],"visual":[{"business_id":"Xjp2aV-s4peSgr7rKOftFQ","photo_id":"7dPq5KAvIy94jdvP1d_J9Q","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/7dPq5KAvIy94jdvP1d_J9Q.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8649601936340332},{"business_id":"Xjp2aV-s4peSgr7rKOftFQ","photo_id":"gHBPfT6fLAOxa3uTiTjXJw","label":"outside","image_url":"/photos/gHBPfT6fLAOxa3uTiTjXJw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8649601936340332},{"business_id":"Xjp2aV-s4peSgr7rKOftFQ","photo_id":"05fXSyv03zv313pXjJLExg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/05fXSyv03zv313pXjJLExg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8391236066818237},{"business_id":"Xjp2aV-s4peSgr7rKOftFQ","photo_id":"iiOu0yxRONzJGJdmFcaFLw","label":"menu","image_url":"/photos/iiOu0yxRONzJGJdmFcaFLw.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.790677011013031},{"business_id":"Xjp2aV-s4peSgr7rKOftFQ","photo_id":"xMpGLREMn7qDowa-2p_nNg","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/xMpGLREMn7qDowa-2p_nNg.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.7613309621810913}]},"notebook_case":null}
